    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-χέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour out together</i>, [
